<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>QCM + Résumé Fiscalité Mauritanie 2025</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif;
            background: #0b1a2e;
            padding: 12px;
            color: #e8edf3;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            padding: 18px 22px 28px;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        /* HEADER */
        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 28px);
            font-weight: 700;
            border-left: 6px solid #0b4f6c;
            padding-left: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .badge {
            background: #0b4f6c;
            color: white;
            font-size: clamp(11px, 2vw, 14px);
            padding: 2px 14px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .prof-credit {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef9e7, #fdebd0);
            border: 2px solid #f1c40f;
            border-radius: 60px;
            padding: 4px 16px;
            font-size: clamp(11px, 1.8vw, 14px);
            color: #7d6608;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 4px 0 12px;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(241, 196, 15, 0.25);
        }
        .prof-credit .whatsapp {
            color: #25D366;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .flex-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px 12px;
        }
        /* MODE TOGGLE */
        .mode-toggle {
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            background: #eef2f7;
            border-radius: 40px;
            padding: 3px;
        }
        .mode-toggle button {
            border: none;
            background: transparent;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 14px);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        .mode-toggle button.active {
            background: #0b4f6c;
            color: white;
        }
        /* STATS */
        .subhead {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: clamp(12px, 1.8vw, 15px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9edf2;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 6px;
        }
        .stats {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .stats span {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 2px 12px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: clamp(11px, 1.6vw, 14px);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }
        .stats .correct-badge {
            background: #d9f2e0;
            color: #0d4a2a;
        }
        .stats .wrong-badge {
            background: #fee9e9;
            color: #7a1a1a;
        }
        .stats .answered-badge {
            background: #e8f4fd;
            color: #0b4f6c;
        }
        .score-negative {
            color: #b91c1c;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .score-positive {
            color: #1e7b4c;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .lang-toggle {
            background: #eef2f7;
            border-radius: 40px;
            padding: 3px;
            display: inline-flex;
            gap: 3px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .lang-toggle button {
            border: none;
            background: transparent;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: clamp(11px, 1.6vw, 13px);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        .lang-toggle button.active {
            background: #0b4f6c;
            color: white;
        }
        .progress {
            background: #e9edf2;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            margin: 12px 0 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            background: #0b4f6c;
            height: 100%;
            width: 0%;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }
        /* QUESTION PANEL */
        .question-panel {
            background: #fafcff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: clamp(14px, 2.5vw, 22px);
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .q-number {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0b4f6c;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: clamp(11px, 1.6vw, 14px);
            padding: 2px 14px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .q-text {
            font-size: clamp(15px, 2.2vw, 19px);
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-align: left;
            direction: ltr;
        }
        .options {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .opt {
            background: white;
            border: 1.5px solid #dde3ec;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: clamp(10px, 1.6vw, 14px) clamp(12px, 2vw, 18px);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.15s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 450;
            text-align: left;
            direction: ltr;
            font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 16px);
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
            touch-action: manipulation;
        }
        .opt:hover {
            background: #f0f6fe;
            border-color: #8ba9d1;
        }
        .opt.selected {
            background: #e1edfb;
            border-color: #1d6f9c;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(11, 79, 108, 0.15);
        }
        .opt.correct {
            background: #d9f2e0;
            border-color: #1e7b4c;
        }
        .opt.wrong {
            background: #fee9e9;
            border-color: #b91c1c;
        }
        .opt .letter {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e3a5f;
            width: 24px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            font-size: clamp(13px, 1.8vw, 15px);
        }
        .action-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }
        .btn {
            background: white;
            border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
            padding: clamp(8px, 1.4vw, 12px) clamp(14px, 2.5vw, 22px);
            border-radius: 60px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: clamp(12px, 1.6vw, 15px);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
            color: #1e293b;
            touch-action: manipulation;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
            min-height: 44px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: #0b4f6c;
            border-color: #0b4f6c;
            color: white;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #083c52;
        }
        .btn-primary:disabled {
            opacity: 0.4;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: #f1f5f9;
        }
        .btn-danger {
            border-color: #b91c1c;
            color: #b91c1c;
        }
        .btn-danger:hover {
            background: #fee9e9;
        }
        .btn-small {
            padding: clamp(5px, 1vw, 8px) clamp(10px, 1.8vw, 16px);
            font-size: clamp(11px, 1.4vw, 13px);
            min-height: 36px;
        }
        .milestone {
            background: #e8f4fd;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            margin: 6px 0;
            border-right: 5px solid #0b4f6c;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            font-size: clamp(12px, 1.6vw, 14px);
        }
        .answer-feedback {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: none;
            text-align: left;
            direction: ltr;
            font-size: clamp(13px, 1.8vw, 15px);
        }
        .answer-feedback.correct {
            display: block;
            background: #d9f2e0;
            border: 2px solid #1e7b4c;
            color: #0d4a2a;
        }
        .answer-feedback.wrong {
            display: block;
            background: #fee9e9;
            border: 2px solid #b91c1c;
            color: #7a1a1a;
        }
        .answer-feedback .correct-answer {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0b4f6c;
        }
        .result-area {
            margin-top: 18px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #dde3ec;
        }
        .result-line {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: clamp(12px, 1.6vw, 14px);
            padding: 5px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #dce2ec;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 4px;
        }
        .result-line:last-child {
            border: none;
        }
        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: clamp(11px, 1.4vw, 13px);
            border-top: 1px solid #e9edf2;
            padding-top: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        /* RÉSUMÉ */
        #resumeSection {
            display: none;
        }
        #qcmSection {
            display: block;
        }
        .summary-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }
        .summary-stats .stat-item {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .summary-stats .stat-item .number {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .summary-stats .stat-item .label {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #64748b;
        }
        .summary-stats .stat-item.green .number {
            color: #1e7b4c;
        }
        .summary-stats .stat-item.red .number {
            color: #b91c1c;
        }
        .summary-stats .stat-item.blue .number {
            color: #0b4f6c;
        }
        .summary-stats .stat-item.orange .number {
            color: #d97706;
        }
        .summary-rules {
            margin-top: 16px;
            border-top: 2px solid #e9edf2;
            padding-top: 14px;
        }
        .summary-rules h3 {
            color: #0b4f6c;
            margin: 18px 0 10px;
            font-size: 19px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e9edf2;
            padding-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .summary-rules h4 {
            color: #0b4f6c;
            margin: 12px 0 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .rule-block {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-right: 4px solid #0b4f6c;
        }
        .rule-block .rule-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #0b4f6c;
        }
        .rule-block .rule-example {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #334155;
            margin-top: 4px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .rule-block .rule-piege {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #b91c1c;
            margin-top: 4px;
            background: #fee9e9;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .rule-block .rule-corrige {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #1e7b4c;
            margin-top: 4px;
            background: #d9f2e0;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .rule-block .rule-ref {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #0b4f6c;
            margin-top: 4px;
            background: #e8f4fd;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .table-taux {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .table-taux th,
        .table-taux td {
            border: 1px solid #dde3ec;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .table-taux th {
            background: #0b4f6c;
            color: white;
        }
        .table-taux tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: #f8fafc;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            body {
                padding: 8px;
            }
            .container {
                padding: 14px 12px 18px;
                border-radius: 20px;
            }
            .flex-row {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }
            .flex-row .lang-toggle {
                align-self: flex-start;
            }
            .action-bar {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }
            .action-bar>div {
                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 6px;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .btn {
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 60px;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 10px 12px;
                font-size: 13px;
                min-height: 48px;
            }
            .btn-small {
                min-height: 40px;
                padding: 8px 12px;
                font-size: 12px;
            }
            .subhead {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
                gap: 6px;
            }
            .stats {
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .stats span {
                font-size: 12px;
                padding: 2px 10px;
            }
            .summary-stats {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 4px;
            }
            .container {
                padding: 10px 8px 14px;
                border-radius: 16px;
            }
            h1 {
                font-size: 17px;
                padding-left: 10px;
                border-left-width: 4px;
            }
            .prof-credit {
                font-size: 11px;
                padding: 3px 12px;
            }
            .question-panel {
                padding: 12px 10px;
            }
            .opt {
                padding: 10px 12px;
                font-size: 14px;
                border-radius: 10px;
            }
            .btn {
                font-size: 12px;
                padding: 8px 10px;
                min-height: 44px;
            }
            .btn-small {
                font-size: 11px;
                padding: 6px 10px;
                min-height: 36px;
            }
            .result-area {
                padding: 10px 12px;
            }
            .result-line {
                font-size: 12px;
            }
            .footer-note {
                font-size: 11px;
            }
            .stats span {
                font-size: 11px;
                padding: 2px 8px;
            }
            .lang-toggle button {
                font-size: 11px;
                padding: 3px 10px;
            }
            .summary-stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
            .table-taux {
                font-size: 11px;
            }
            .table-taux th,
            .table-taux td {
                padding: 4px 6px;
            }
        }
        .opt,
        .btn {
            -webkit-touch-callout: none;
        }
        .opt:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }
        .btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.97);
        }
        * {
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>
            <span>📘 Fiscalité Mauritanie 2025</span>
            <span class="badge">QCM + Résumé</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="flex-row">
            <div class="prof-credit">
                🧑‍🏫 <strong>Prof. Mohamed Yahya Taleb Abdellahi</strong>
                <span class="whatsapp">📱 WhatsApp : 30545727</span>
                — 🍀 Bonne chance !
            </div>
            <div class="lang-toggle">
                <button id="langFr" class="active">🇫🇷 Français</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- MODE TOGGLE -->
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:flex-end; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            <div class="mode-toggle">
                <button id="modeQcm" class="active">📝 QCM</button>
                <button id="modeResume">📖 Résumé</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ============================================================
        SECTION QCM
        ============================================================ -->
        <div id="qcmSection">
            <div id="milestoneMessage" class="milestone" style="display:none;">
                <span>🎯 <span id="milestoneText">Félicitations !</span></span>
                <span style="font-size:13px; color:#0b4f6c;">✅ Continuez !</span>
            </div>

            <div class="subhead">
                <div class="stats">
                    <span class="correct-badge">✅ <span id="correctCount">0</span></span>
                    <span class="wrong-badge">❌ <span id="wrongCount">0</span></span>
                    <span class="answered-badge">⏳ <span id="answeredCount">0</span>/500</span>
                </div>
                <div>📊 <span id="scoreDisplay">0.00</span></div>
            </div>

            <div class="progress">
                <div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill" style="width:0%"></div>
            </div>

            <div id="questionContainer" class="question-panel">
                <div class="q-number" id="qNum">Question 1 / 500</div>
                <div class="q-text" id="qTextFr">Chargement des questions...</div>
                <div class="options" id="optionsContainer"></div>
                <div class="answer-feedback" id="answerFeedback"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="action-bar">
                <div>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline btn-small" id="prevBtn" disabled>◀ Préc.</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline btn-small" id="nextBtn">Suiv. ▶</button>
                </div>
                <div class="action-right">
                    <button class="btn btn-danger btn-small" id="resetBtn">⟳ Réinit.</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" id="submitBtn">✅ Valider</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-danger btn-small" id="stopBtn">⏹ Stop</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-success btn-small" id="resultBtn">📊 Résultat</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="resultArea" class="result-area">
                <div class="result-line"><span>📌 Dernière action</span><span id="lastAction">—</span></div>
                <div class="result-line"><span>📈 Progression</span><span id="progressText">0 %</span></div>
                <div class="result-line"><span>🏆 Estimation</span><span id="levelEstimate">Débutant</span></div>
                <div class="result-line" style="border-bottom: none; margin-top:4px;">
                    <span>📋 Détail</span>
                    <span id="detailStats">Bonnes:0 | Mauvaises:0 | NR:500</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ============================================================
        SECTION RÉSUMÉ
        ============================================================ -->
        <div id="resumeSection">
            <div class="summary-stats">
                <div class="stat-item green"><div class="number">25%</div><div class="label">IS – Art. 51</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item blue"><div class="number">100 000</div><div class="label">IS – Minimum MRU</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item orange"><div class="number">30%</div><div class="label">IBAPP – Art. 87</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item blue"><div class="number">125 000</div><div class="label">IBAPP – Minimum MRU</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item green"><div class="number">16%</div><div class="label">TVA – Art. 230</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item red"><div class="number">40%</div><div class="label">PIT – Art. 114</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item blue"><div class="number">15%</div><div class="label">RPD – IS réduit</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item blue"><div class="number">0,6%</div><div class="label">Taxe apprentissage</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item orange"><div class="number">4%</div><div class="label">STR – IS/PIT</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item blue"><div class="number">1,75%</div><div class="label">GTA – Min réel</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item blue"><div class="number">36 mois</div><div class="label">Mining – Exonération IS</div></div>
                <div class="stat-item blue"><div class="number">15 ans</div><div class="label">Zone franche – Agrément</div></div>
            </div>

            <div class="summary-rules">
                <h3>🏢 IS – Impôt sur les Sociétés (Art. 51 CGI)</h3>
                <div class="rule-block">
                    <div class="rule-title">📌 Règle générale</div>
                    <div class="rule-example">
                        <strong>IS = MAX(25% × Bénéfice ; 2% × Produits imposables)</strong><br>
                        Minimum : <strong>100 000 MRU</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rule-ref">📖 Art. 51 CGI</div>
                    <div class="rule-piege">⚠️ En cas de perte, l'impôt minimum reste dû.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="rule-block">
                    <div class="rule-title">📝 Exemple – Piège (CA élevé)</div>
                    <div class="rule-example">
                        Bénéfice = 500 000 MRU<br>
                        Produits = 40 000 000 MRU<br>
                        25% × 500 000 = 125 000<br>
                        2% × 40 000 000 = <strong>800 000 MRU</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rule-piege">⚠️ Toujours comparer avec 2% des produits.</div>
                </div>

                <h3>👤 IBAPP – Art. 87 CGI</h3>
                <div class="rule-block">
                    <div class="rule-title">📌 Les 3 régimes</div>
                    <div class="rule-example">
                        • CA &lt; 3 M → Forfait : 3% du CA<br>
                        • CA 3-5 M → Réel intermédiaire : 30% bénéfice / 2,5% CA<br>
                        • CA &gt; 5 M → Réel normal : 30% bénéfice / 2,5% CA
                    </div>
                    <div class="rule-piege">⚠️ CA = 3 000 000 exact = intermédiaire (pas forfait).</div>
                </div>

                <h3>💰 PIT / ITS – Art. 114 CGI</h3>
                <div class="rule-block">
                    <div class="rule-title">📌 Barème progressif</div>
                    <div class="rule-example">
